WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:09.942
Cora and Mo watched the shell.

2
00:00:09.943 --> 00:00:13.913
"It's opening!" Mo said.

3
00:00:13.914 --> 00:00:16.782
Cora swam closer.

4
00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:21.033
In the bottom lay the red arrow.

5
00:00:21.034 --> 00:00:24.257
In the top was a picture.

6
00:00:24.258 --> 00:00:28.459
"It's a turtle," Cora said.

7
00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:32.979
The turtle's shell had lines and spots.

8
00:00:32.980 --> 00:00:35.426
Mo bit his lip.

9
00:00:35.427 --> 00:00:37.970
"We need to scare the shark, Cora.

10
00:00:37.971 --> 00:00:41.686
And that turtle is not scary!"

11
00:00:41.687 --> 00:00:50.190
"Let's see what happens," Cora said.

12
00:00:50.191 --> 00:00:53.246
The arrow darted out of the cave.

13
00:00:53.247 --> 00:00:57.472
"Come on, Mo!" Cora shot after it.

14
00:00:57.473 --> 00:01:01.653
"Let's go!"

15
00:01:01.654 --> 00:01:09.935
Mo sighed and followed Cora.

16
00:01:09.936 --> 00:01:13.923
Soon they reached the shallows.

17
00:01:13.924 --> 00:01:16.865
Cora looked around.

18
00:01:16.866 --> 00:01:25.167
The sky above was bright blue.

19
00:01:25.168 --> 00:01:29.108
The arrow pointed at something in the water.

20
00:01:29.109 --> 00:01:32.858
"That looks like a big rock," Mo said.

21
00:01:32.859 --> 00:01:35.989
Cora and Mo swam closer.

22
00:01:35.990 --> 00:01:40.460
The rock had lines and spots.

23
00:01:40.461 --> 00:01:45.090
Cora gasped. "It's not a rock.

24
00:01:45.091 --> 00:01:47.805
It's an old sea turtle!"

25
00:01:47.806 --> 00:01:52.739
"Yikes," Mo said. "He's huge!"

26
00:01:52.740 --> 00:01:57.109
Cora and Mo swam over to the turtle.

27
00:01:57.110 --> 00:02:04.054
"Mr. Turtle, we need your help," Mo said.

28
00:02:04.055 --> 00:02:09.653
The turtle frowned. "Go away!

29
00:02:09.654 --> 00:02:15.587
And don't bother me again!"

